config BR2_PACKAGE_OCAML3
	bool "ocaml3"
	help
	  OCaml 3.07 bytecode interpreter and interactive toplevel.

	  Builds the native ocamlrun bytecode interpreter for the target,
	  and installs the host-built OCaml toplevel and standard library
	  (bytecode is architecture-independent).

	  https://github.com/ocaml/ocaml
